                        "mobile_width": "100",
                        "text": "<p>Ashwagandha works. The evidence is genuinely strong. But the quality of the extract determines the quality of the outcome — and most of what's available on the market doesn't use the forms that the clinical research actually studied.<br/>Read the label. Ask for the extract form. Expect a specific answer.</p>",
